[[Amulet of Feasting]] is a rare item normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]] from the shop. It massively hastens all [[Food]]s in a very long-range cone, which is an unmatched boon for a [[Food]] build. It additionally restocks with a random [[Food]] when any [[Food]] is bought, guaranteeing an endless supply whenever a single [[Food]] happens to be offered. This restock can even include [[Food]]s from other characters.
